      "name": "/#__cloud__/Local Model/Ask",
      "id": "ask-a-local-model-ask",
      "description": "Asks a model on this computer a fixed question with one blank, filled from a list, and returns one answer from a list — or fires Failure with an Error Code and lets the app carry on.",
